<metadata><name>Civil (Iron Mountain) Tour</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:241-3: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.395464" lon="-122.168592"><ele>1161.8</ele><name>Iron Mountain road at Highway 20</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:iron-mountain-road-hwy20 (OSM node 40233220, start of Forest Road 2000-035); confidence: high; pdf_page: 243; book_elev_ft: 3840; quote: drive 1.5 miles west of Tombstone Pass to the Iron Mountain road</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.398462" lon="-122.177019"><ele>1228.1</ele><name>First turn, route turns east</name><desc>source: OSM node 40233259 on FR 2000-035, 0.53 mi from the highway, where the road bends from north-west to east; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 244; quote: The first 0.6 mile from the highway parking area is moderately steep to a junction where the route turns eastward</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.405625" lon="-122.153683"><ele>1331.2</ele><name>Switchback (end of the scenic tour)</name><desc>source: OSM node 40328113, the hairpin of FR 2000-035 at 2.05 mi; the road ends 0.55 mi beyond (book: 0.5); confidence: high; pdf_page: 243; book_elev_ft: 4340; quote: leads 2.1 miles to a switchback at 4,340 feet with dramatic views</desc></wpt>
